      "text": "2026四大经济周期同时转向",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p1",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "核心观点",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p1-1",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "1. 四大周期同时转向\n2. 指数涨但分化严重\n3. 旧模式退出新模式形成\n4. 理解周期比预测更重要",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p2",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "四大经济周期",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p2-1",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "基钦周期: 3-5年(库存)\n朱格拉周期: 7-11年(投资)\n库兹涅茨: 15-25年(房地产)\n康德拉季耶夫: 45-60年(技术)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p3",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "2026周期状态",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p3-1",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "库存周期: 触底\n投资周期: 启动\n房地产: 筑底\nAI技术: 萌芽",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p4",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "投资启示",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "id": "p4-1",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "• 旧增长模式退出: 房地产、人口红利\n• 新增长模式形成: AI、新能源、高端制造\n• 理解周期位置比预测涨跌更重要",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": "Virgil"
    }
  ]
